    "A10, Euclid's axiom", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "b46e9d13-77fb-4ca2-a938-8928a4fa8d6f"], Cell["\<\
The Euclidean axiom, stated with betweenness and equidistance.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"8741442d-a6b5-4f94-ad5d-34dc68c7bc4b"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"069d9792-f140-46c2-838c-\
