Cell["\<\
The level set at distance 1 from a diagonal is eight isolated vertices, so \
through any of them there is no parallel.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"cfcc7cb4-b6aa-4c97-bf1f-d183ab935a51"],

